`backend/data/idioms.curated.json` is derived from that repository's
`data/idiom.json`. The derivation keeps all 30,895 idiom entries and their
pinyin, retains explanation / derivation / example prose for the two lower
difficulty tiers only, and adds two computed fields (a per-idiom minimum
character frequency, and a difficulty tier). No idiom text was edited.

